'''July Gauntlet II''' (続・7月強襲！, ''Zoku・7 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''Continued・July Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during July and was added in the [[Version 10.6 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Never Not Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Not Summer!]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
July Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Not Summer Lvs''' (だって超夏 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of an Not Summer can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[July Gauntlet II/Not Summer Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*July Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Summer!]] and [[Never Not Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Not Summer!]].

